## 3.2 Submenu selection

When a user selects a submenu item:

1. Highlight the selected submenu.
2. Highlight its parent category.
3. Navigate to the exact corresponding page.
4. Load the selected module.
5. Retain the selected birth profile.
6. Retain the chart configuration.
7. Display the correct module-specific interface.
8. Update breadcrumbs and page heading.
